"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1090487570291275&title=%09I+want+to+talk+to+you+about+this+upcoming+election.+The+truth+is%2C+it%E2%80%99s+not+about+left+versus+right.+It%E2%80%99s+something+just+far+more+simple.+And+that+is%3A+right+versus+wrong.Is+it+right+that+the+Trump+Admin+is+cutting+millions+of+people%E2%80%99s+healthcare+through+the+Medicaid+cuts%3F+That+includes+thousands+of+people+right+here+in+this+district.And+is+it+right+that+the+Trump+Administration+is+still+trying+to+interfere+with+our+election%3FYou%E2%80%99d+agree+with+me+that+those+are+wrong%2C+and+I%E2%80%99m+proud+to+be+fighting+against+them.But+I+also+believe+that+it%E2%80%99s+really+important+to+fight+to+grow+our+economy%2C+to+support+the+brand+new+space+industry+that+is+being+built+out+right+here+in+this+district.And+I+think+it%E2%80%99s+also+important+to+protect+the+natural+beauty+of+our+world+for+our+children.Those+things+are+right.And+I%E2%80%99m+proud+to+be+fighting+for+those+things+too.So%2C+I%E2%80%99m+glad+that+you+care+about%2C+and+are+focused+on%2C+the+difference+between+right+and+wrong%2C+not+right+versus+left.And+your+support+and+your+vote+will+give+us+the+energy+to+keep+on+fighting+for+those+things+in+the+future+and+for+our+district.www.chris4wa.com+%09%09",
